  "details": "I keep losing my keyboard when I go to type something. So I would like a feature where you will press a button or two on your controllers and the keyboard will be reset to right in front of your vision. And I also want to be able to move the typing bar around. \n\nExtra info- For instance, press both of your grips or triggers at the same time for One and one half seconds and your keyboard will be reset. And also a lock button next to the typing bar so we can choose to move it.",
